  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 grant - complimentary nutrition program to EU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to improve nutrition, survival, and thriving of women, adolescents, and children under five through strengthened community-based approaches, multisectoral service access, and an enabling governance environment in 10 districts of North-Western and Luapula Provinces. Building on the Equal Chances for Human Development (EC4HD) programme supported by the European Union and lessons from SUN-II, this initiative focuses on equity, sustainability, and learning. Importantly, the design also leverages Zambia&#x2019;s Social Cash Transfer (SCT) programme, currently targeting over 1.3 million households nationally, as a platform to link nutrition sensitive cash plus interventions for vulnerable households.</narrative>
  </description>
